Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 21:19:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 00/53] ours base for r226: moe-expert-cache.cu stays at r206
 (r207+ host-pool work not carried, pool mode at r206)

r207-r226 rewrote the host pool path of moe-expert-cache.cu.  It overlaps code our series replaces, and production runs
--host-experts mmap.  Keep the r206 file, answer moe_cache_table_is_pool with false, and stub the new loader interface
(heat ranking, pool budget, fill mode).
